     ("Excess permanganate with a strong reducing metal in strongly basic solution is reduced to:", "Green manganate, MnO₄²⁻", "Mn²⁺", "Manganese metal", "Mn₂O₇"),
     ("Mixing silver nitrate and sodium phosphate solutions gives:", "A yellow precipitate of Ag₃PO₄", "No visible change", "A white precipitate of Ag₂O", "Silver metal"),
